  "name": null,
  "problem": "Suppose the following random sample was drawn from the uniform distribution $U[0,1].$ \n\n$$\n0.041,\\,0.137,\\,0.782\n$$\n\nUse these numbers to generate three random numbers that follow a probability distribution with the PDF $f(x),$ given by\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{{x}^{3}},\\, & x\\ge 1, \\\\ 0,\\, & \\text{otherwise.}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRound your answers to $3$ decimal places.",
